==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~16 seconds<sup>120f~480f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is where the difficulty increases a bit. Use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] to kill the Mooths. After all the Mooths are dead, use [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] to finish off the Le'boin.

